    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome To Glenn State!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After over a year of intense study sessions and sleepless all-nighters, you\u2019ve finally clawed your way out of the GPA pit you dug for yourself and transferred out of Glenn State\u2019s backwater Kurtington campus. Now, in your final semester of college, you\u2019ve made it to the university\u2019s main campus: Glenn State College Valley, where the booze flows freely and the parties never stop (allegedly).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it\u2019s not that simple. With a graduation requirement of at least 3.00, you\u2019re not exactly sitting pretty with a GPA of only 2.80.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you focus on your studies and secure your future?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dive into the wild social scene and risk it all for the college experience you\u2019ve been missing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you rise above the chaos and begin your epic comeback by graduating while winning the heart of someone truly special?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching romance paths shaped by your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GPA management system where you must balance between your studies and social life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three romanceable characters, each with unique personalities, struggles, and arcs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings determined by your grades and relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique college setting that highlights the challenges and humor of modern university life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An authentic focus on international student and third culture experiences</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome To Glenn State!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After over a year of intense study sessions and sleepless all-nighters, you\u2019ve finally clawed your way out of the GPA pit you dug for yourself and transferred out of Glenn State\u2019s backwater Kurtington campus. Now, in your final semester of college, you\u2019ve made it to the university\u2019s main campus: Glenn State College Valley, where the booze flows freely and the parties never stop (allegedly).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it\u2019s not that simple. With a graduation requirement of at least 3.00, you\u2019re not exactly sitting pretty with a GPA of only 2.80.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you focus on your studies and secure your future?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dive into the wild social scene and risk it all for the college experience you\u2019ve been missing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you rise above the chaos and begin your epic comeback by graduating while winning the heart of someone truly special?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching romance paths shaped by your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GPA management system where you must balance between your studies and social life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three romanceable characters, each with unique personalities, struggles, and arcs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings determined by your grades and relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique college setting that highlights the challenges and humor of modern university life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An authentic focus on international student and third culture experiences</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Last Term, First Love is a dating-focused visual novel where you balance romance, academics, and wild campus life. Manage your GPA, navigate social challenges, and pursue love while facing the realities of modern campus culture and the international student experience.",
